<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/3rd-century">3rd century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">260 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">260 CE in world history: 3 events, 1 death and 2 states founded. 145 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
